~other races, then perhaps we could be less careful about pornography.

What exactly is this "exploitation" you refer to? And could you lease
explain it's existence would mean that the State should be permitted to
decide the reading material of citizens? This seems wrong to me,
independently of any other wrongs which may exist in society.

