between this factor an the effect of pornography. First though, we have
to establish that there are effects which arise from pornography, so
we're still at square one.

How would one set about rating pornography for degrees of being
"exploitative in appearance"?

~Unfortunately there is an appetite for darker stuff, else the Police
~chief in the recent Moroccan court case wouldn't have made so much
